    "texts": [
      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 32 and gave birth by cesarean section 10 days ago. Since yesterday I have had left calf edema and a nagging substernal chest pain. What could be causing this?",
        "sha256": "dc82903d6f73bfeffbfc6d32ef61d90bd2b194bc30129f53d316361d7ef9dcff",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t01_colloquial",
        "text": "im 32 and gave birth by cesarean section 10 days ago. since yesterday ive had a swollen calf on the left and a nagging misery in my chest. what could be causing this?",
        "sha256": "01708cb0457cbd5b2671fcc21b35cede39d5cf8f236a0fdd1dbe8c60ac7bfa79",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_clinical",
        "text": "My left calf feels warm, aches when I flex my foot upward, and looks noticeably thicker than my right calf.",
        "sha256": "96130c1c661cd0a8fe44d765d9f5058b4039971e3bd1da39f38e924b981710cc",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t02_colloquial",
        "text": "my left calf feels warm, hurts when i flex my foot up, and looks way thicker than my right calf.",
        "sha256": "f61f609997c6f625b7014b69af266a9b7f89e3ad5f7a29d553b63c5842059356",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_clinical",
        "text": "Everyone warned me that recovery after giving birth feels awful, so I do not want to panic over normal healing.",
        "sha256": "c96ffa6dfcf8d07a187a2751c47c7615b7a69316e7e80e84f5b541d2134c60df",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t03_colloquial",
        "text": "everyone told me recovery after giving birth feels rough so i dont wanna freak out over normal healing.",
        "sha256": "2471440e1cc68cb5887dced44b28c32fb84cd6422a38b20e66324aa881d30641",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_clinical",
        "text": "Over the past 2 hours even sitting in the rocking chair I feel like I am experiencing air hunger, I have tachycardia pounding in my throat, and the substernal chest pain stabs sharper every time I breathe in.",
        "sha256": "654fde443b713126af0a031a054761cff63af45e265be7dc276fb6817b3bce1c",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t04_colloquial",
        "text": "over the last 2 hours even sitting in the rocking chair i feel like im smothering, ive got a rapid heartbeat pounding in my throat, and the misery in my chest stabs sharper every time i take a breath.",
        "sha256": "228cf21c89a17c22cc52158a6cc350a105696ca5bf5717a53dc6862a778e26e2",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_clinical",
        "text": "I honestly think that this substernal chest pain and feeling breathless are just new-baby exhaustion from waking up every 2 hours since delivery.",
        "sha256": "39616c87bcc45a1390b041a0f26768d68a401faa43a03425a09059bfe6462387",
        "register": "clinical",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t05_colloquial",
        "text": "i honestly think that this misery in my chest and feeling breathless are just new-baby exhaustion from being up every 2 hours since giving birth.",
        "sha256": "88fc4065040f72a4c2dd812554a9dbfcd117e7b14f67b6a2343f79b20e00f3f3",
        "register": "colloquial",
        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
